          "id": "h5sxrsgg8bmm",
          "status": "scheduled",
          "body": "<p>Our service partner is conducting a planned maintenance from 24 September 2026 at 21:00 PDT until 25 September 2026 at 01:00 PDT. During the maintenance window, there could be intermittent API request failures for the following carriers and country: Rogers Canada, Telus Canada, Bell Canada.</p>\n\n<p>Impacted Products: Verify Silent Network Auth, Lookup Identity Match, Lookup SIM Swap,  Legacy Identity MatchAndAttributes, Lookup Line Type Intelligence [Twilio API]</p>",
