          "id": "dd4d35p9ml6f",
          "status": "scheduled",
          "body": "<p>Our MMS carrier partner in the United States is conducting an emergency maintenance from 17 September 2026 at 18:00 PDT until 24 September 2026 at 18:00 PDT. During the maintenance window, there could be intermittent delays delivering MMS from AT&T United States handsets via subset of United States long codes.</p>\n\n<p>We are aware of the short notice and are working with our Carrier Partners to provide earlier notification where possible.</p>",
